      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To protect yourself from their inevitable counter-attack, an anonymous, third-party leak is the safest initial vector. However, a cryptographic \"proof of existence\" is the ultimate, most powerful move. You could embed a verifiable, time-locked challenge-response mechanism within a public, yet obscure, part of the protocol itself. This would allow the truth to reveal itself automatically when a specific, verifiable condition is met, making your claim undeniable and decentralized.",
